 85.5 0 112v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V306.2c0-10.7-12.9-16-20.5-8.5l-40 40c-2.2 2.3-3.5 5.3-3.5 8.5z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-edit icons\"></i> --> Edit Insert</a> <a class=\"btn btn-lg addbut\" href=\"workflow/13938\"><svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-list-alt fa-w-16 icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-fa-processed=\"\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"list-alt\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M464 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48h416c26.51 0 48 21.49 48 48v352c0 26.51-21.49 48-48 48zM128 120c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm288-136v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-list-alt icons\"></i> --> Insert Workflow</a><br><br><div class=\"whitebar\"><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><h2>Protect Paris</h2></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><strong>By: <a href=\"user-view/22\">Diana Lucas</a> | Production</strong></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><div class=\"col-sm-9 inspadd\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Proposal</h3><br><span class=\"headin\">Show:</span> Carte Blanche<br><br><span class=\"headin\">One Liner (Tonight on Carte Blanche...):</span><br>On the ground in Paris! We explore the impact of the terror attacks that have shocked the world.<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Summary: </span><br>JOHN WEBB is in Paris to bring us the story of ordinary French people and how they feel about the terrorist attacks on Charlie Hebdo. Have these events changed their lives forever?<br>\n<br>\nWe travel to Paris and look at a City under siege. Look at what happened with relevance to a deeper insight and implications. For the French Media Freedon is engrained, how far will they go to protect media freedom.<br>\nIs this bout of terrorism a new phase of radicalized terror, happening all around the world, Home bred terrorists, dissatisfied youth who leave France and come back radicalized to inflict death and destruction.<br>\nIs the future of Muslim Community in Europe, threatened?<br>\n<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Further information: </span><br>What were the impacts of the Unity Rally and what did it do and mean for the French.  Charle Hebdo defiantly decided to publish a survivor issue, we go behind the scenes and took to them.  We attend the UNESCO conference put together because of the bloody attacks,  \" After Charlie Hebdo\" we  go on streets and and talk to people on the ground....On the day of the publication  we  see the long lines.  We talk to Islamists<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Locations:</span><br>Paris<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Extra Footage:</span><br>undefined<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\">Status:</span> <span class=\"app\">Approved</span><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Proposal Date:</span> Friday, 09 January 2015<br><span class=\"headin\">Approved By:</span> Wynand Grobler<br><span class=\"headin\">Approval Date:</span> 16 January 2015<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-defa